(include_subdirs unqualified)

; Module layers (see README.md for the ownership rule). Physical subdirs only:
; `include_subdirs unqualified` keeps module identity equal to the basename, so
; nothing outside this library references these paths.
;
;   core/      legacy strategy-agnostic decision engine (reference; retire with the
;              equivalence harness)
;   platform/  central accounting + per-venue capability descriptors
;   actions/   action registry (the code-side extension surface) + the functor
;              bridge onto the reference grid (Make Strategy_cycle_engine)
;   protocol/  strategy-file interpreter: parse, validate, compile, run steps
;   harness/   equivalence tooling: traces, recorder, diff, `dio strategy` CLI

